{"ID":"20240513083410-tamknat","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083410-tamknat","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083410-tamknat\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513105254-gqg2e1o\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513105455-cqr8qh9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:2000,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513105455-cqr8qh9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:829,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:829\u0026#125;","title":"045","type":"doc","updated":"20240515124156"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513105254-gqg2e1o","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 1015px;","id":"20240513105254-gqg2e1o","updated":"20240515124156"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"倪醫師病案紀錄   初診日期：2008/03/25"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"030-2 E,D"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"男"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"17歲，中等"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/03/25"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"血小板減少、紫瘢症，使用免疫球蛋白注射治療"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 睡可通宵"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. 大便每日一行"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. 小便淡黃、清"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4. 胃口易餓、吃很多、可吃任何東西"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5. 口渴尚好，喜溫飲"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6. 睡時身熱"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7. 易出汗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8. 晨起累，運動後也累"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9. 雙足溫"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10. 手指尖冷，手掌溫，額溫"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"洪大中空"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→脈大為癆"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡黃白厚；早上白濕"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→濕盛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、眼診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"腎區大、反應差"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→腎陽不足 脾區過大→脾陽不足  因脾主肌、肝主筋，所以運動後累。 肝區破洞  "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3、身體："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"膚表可見青紫網狀血脈"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→因脾陽不足，脾主肌肉，故血脈(屬陰)浮現肌表；陽不固，則陰不內守!"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"腎陽不足、脾陽不足"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方：當歸四逆(建中)湯合桂芍知母湯加減"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 桂枝三錢  白芍六錢  炙甘草三錢  大棗十枚  當歸二錢  木通二錢  細辛二錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→當歸四逆(建中)湯，補後天之本"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白朮三錢  茯苓五錢  淮山三錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→健脾去濕"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"柴胡三錢  鬱金五錢  黃芩三錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→疏肝"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"澤瀉五錢  補骨脂三錢  敗龜板三錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→補腎"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮附子三錢  麻黃二錢  防風三錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→桂芍知母湯 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"十付  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"九碗煮三碗  早晚飯前各一碗  服時加一匙麥芽糖"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.  HT-46(六味地黃丸)"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→補先天之本  302  午飯及睡前服"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 自體免疫系統疾病(當西醫不知道病人身上到底發生了啥事時冠上的病名!)，其實來源於疫苗!"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以下為患者父親的傳真內容摘要："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2008/5/5"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3/25至診所經倪師親自診療後第五次療程，這次像倪師常說的真正經方效力那樣立竿見影，頑固病情終有改善。身體情況如下："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"額溫："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有點清涼感，少少時有點溫，但是近星期來手掌溫度比頭暖些。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"掌溫："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"溫暖，掌面顏色呈現淺紅及白色小點或塊狀混雜，手背沒有，手心無熱，十指尖比掌面涼些。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"足溫："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"溫暖，色紅。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"大便："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每日最少一次，有時成條狀，有時間斷，濕爛程度比以前改善許多，大便顏色時淺時淺黑。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"小便："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"晨起第一泡尿顏色較深黃，平時為淡黃，一天小便次數4-5次。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"胃口："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"食慾早晚正常，沒有非常飢餓感，二餐後亦沒有非常飢餓感。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"睡眠："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"正常，可睡通霄，身體溫暖並無熱感，但有時額頭有點汗。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"口渴："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"現在常飲室溫水。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"、舌苔："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"舌苔淡黃而濕。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"、痰："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"從來沒有，也沒有咳嗽。    "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008年3月25日到漢唐診所後病情明顯好轉，現況：畏寒大為改善，身體比以前溫暖，在家不像以前一樣需穿冬季大棉衫；精神體力改善很多，較不易疲倦；不見血小板減少及皮下出血現象，以前每月21到23日一定要去醫院打針（免疫球蛋白IVIG），因為當血小板數值降低到0或5以下時，其面部及手皮膚容易看到皮下出血。現在已經有八個星期沒有去醫院，身體並沒有不良反應，健康好轉中，這就是倪師經方的功勞。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2008/5/19"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"近日身體情況和5月5日傳真相似，不過這幾天有時在頸部皮下有出血現象，但隔日或二日後就消失，這是血小板很低的情況下才會出現，不過這種現象比以前減少很多。由於現在身體大為改善，沒有去醫院做不必要的檢查，所以這次沒有附上醫院檢查報告，以前原則上每月21到23日一定要到醫院抽血驗血小板數值，再考慮是否需要打針，通常99%是需要的。服用中藥已經超過二個多月，身體明顯好轉，謝謝！    "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"畏寒大為改善，但是仍然有畏寒感。以前發病當年很容易得到傷風感冒。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20240513105428-c2ycqv2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240513105428-c2ycqv2"}},{"ID":"20240513105455-cqr8qh9","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 1021px;","id":"20240513105455-cqr8qh9","updated":"20240515124138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：3/25/2008"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Eng Danny"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Male"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5/19/2008"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"血小板減少紫瘢、紫斑，服前方後一切好轉，續療程"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"睡眠："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"很好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"大便："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"正常，每天都有"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"胃口："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"口渴："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"偶爾"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"小便："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡黃"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、 雙足溫，身溫正常"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"體力："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"還好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8、 手稍涼額稍熱，手皮稍粗不夠潤澤"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"、汗："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"運動時會流汗 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→ 問汗是要檢查其心臟功能為何，心臟功能正常時晚上睡覺不盜汗，運動時會出汗。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"洪緩有力"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡白紅"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、眼診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"腎陽反應不足；肝區較小，有褐點、小洞（肝積毒素）；脾區大"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 病人進步中"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、同3/25方                 　　　"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"20付"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9 "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"→"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 3"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚餐前各一碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"※吃完此方後先停，因已改善，以後改吃藥丸"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、HT-68 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→ 清肝 一斤  × 2罐"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、HT-46 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→ 固腎 一斤  × 1罐"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"初診時睡覺還好，大便正常，小便淡黃，胃口非常容易餓，食量大，這對病情是有利的。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"假如病人有吃類固醇，胃口會很好。"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"睡覺時身體熱容易出汗，因小孩是純陽之體（14歲以前）。起床時體力不是很好，與腎臟功能有關，腎臟功能好起床時精神好，一下就起床而不賴床。    "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"當時身體狀況還正常，沒有吃西藥，只有吃過抗生素，睡覺還好，大便正常，小便淡黃，胃口非常容易餓，食量大，但就是其脈大，以其年齡體格來說，其血管較大（因血管中有濕累積而把血管撐大，如此會影響到造血機能），脈大為癆，屬於腎陽脾陽皆不足的情況，我們用桂枝芍藥知母湯，桂枝芍藥知母湯除了用來治療膝關節炎之外，也用來治療癆症。    "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"補腎用補骨脂、敗龜板，也用澤瀉將小便利出來以減輕腎臟負擔，暫時取代腎臟功能。動物性藥滋陰能力強，力大，例如鹿角膠取其性烈，得到迅速的效果，植物性藥藥緩力專。    "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桂枝芍藥知母湯中為了要建中（建其脾陽），而把白芍加重，但其肝腎仍需一段時間調理，吃藥後大便會較軟而不硬，是因濕從大便排出。  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原來體內怕冷，在大熱天家中仍需穿冬衣，目前體力好轉，而因血小板減少所導致的皮下出血情況也獲得改善，今天來覆診，我們仍用中醫的標準來檢查，中醫治療的標準是要手掌要熱，額要涼，上半身涼，下半身熱。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}